    {
      "id": "s03_00",
      "who": "pip",
      "text": "Why is it even haunted?",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_00.wav",
      "sha256": "8174b5cb9acfc3cf5eec4f32819cb148f286682ba5dbaba3dcde91881057be43",
      "start": 46.05,
      "duration": 1.309591836734694,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_01",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "Depends who you ask.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_01.wav",
      "sha256": "da2132484d86049150dc5bc442fabe89bb4a2915d130bb82515dd7cb629eba8a",
      "start": 47.75959183673469,
      "duration": 0.8525850340136054,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_02",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "A ghost band. They died mid-song. You can hear them tuning up.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_02.wav",
      "sha256": "43afd74cef62cbcbba67e4dcac2e78de999a9a92f291445f6566a5a3991cc399",
      "start": 49.0121768707483,
      "duration": 3.9253741496598638,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_03",
      "who": "pip",
      "text": "I heard a cursed bake sale.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_03.wav",
      "sha256": "b6fe116f6b47bdb69abdba5cb85ac78bd264df3bd0197491a142ca01cb95a07f",
      "start": 53.33755102040816,
      "duration": 1.453877551020408,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_04",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "How is a bake sale cursed?",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_04.wav",
      "sha256": "74aea368e705b69dae08cd84f061b2ba7b21ecf060ae781824a18dbae6b1a244",
      "start": 55.19142857142857,
      "duration": 1.7615419501133787,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_05",
      "who": "pip",
      "text": "Nobody came. For a hundred years.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_05.wav",
      "sha256": "2098016a2278446c2fbcb2027972498a811f80fa70b37c1c5ec392a59d6dc725",
      "start": 57.35297052154194,
      "duration": 1.954263038548753,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_06",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "What did you hear, Rocco?",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_06.wav",
      "sha256": "330e4cb882010c5ba9f91418f49627fa8d1ce3766fa67e5550f39d4a067be674",
      "start": 59.70723356009069,
      "duration": 1.1414285714285715,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_07",
      "who": "rocco",
      "text": "It's old.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_07.wav",
      "sha256": "d50de206205f860c3a3f627634b473ecfce7e1f83afb9a101e6f3f8fc9c27080",
      "start": 61.24866213151926,
      "duration": 0.5629251700680272,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_08",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "That's it?",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_08.wav",
      "sha256": "5c1269d5763f80d02f7a3d180c19d3c212eb7690e4cf800abd3bddd1ddcd3b03",
      "start": 62.211587301587286,
      "duration": 0.41820861678004534,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_09",
      "who": "rocco",
      "text": "Old is pretty scary.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_09.wav",
      "sha256": "6958a0954ccd0115325c254b60b70389e13ba0d392d63a942ecc47e2a3b5fbb5",
      "start": 63.02979591836733,
      "duration": 1.2361678004535148,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_10",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "But what was it, before? Who built it?",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_10.wav",
      "sha256": "620436ee63f9fba167cd1033068237a36076611314b3b1f59795604dbeafc774",
      "start": 64.66596371882085,
      "duration": 1.9476643990929705,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_11",
      "who": "pip",
      "text": "...Huh.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_11.wav",
      "sha256": "53197d40841d14d1a2888348fb735c735c31c6dcdeb7bda6c916f2bf410740b8",
      "start": 67.01362811791383,
      "duration": 0.34383219954648525,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_12",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "Listen, dares are optional. Legally. We could go swimming instead.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_12.wav",
      "sha256": "70b12d86f33a4462df054e8b07fc8b08c5a5904895bf25f392cbc89c5e44b5be",
      "start": 67.75746031746031,
      "duration": 3.3169160997732425,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_13",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "Are you scared?",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_13.wav",
      "sha256": "f9efc0556cc391969261819ea12b96a702685bc7774c83224c9c22a4c96ea982",
      "start": 71.47437641723356,
      "duration": 0.7409750566893424,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_14",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "I'm a lifeguard. I guard life. Yours, specifically.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_14.wav",
      "sha256": "13f50c2163c6b6b31c273f6d2488151f9a71c8b153b6f200808aee0c7ef8ba0d",
      "start": 72.6153514739229,
      "duration": 3.1325850340136054,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_15",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "I'm going round the front.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_15.wav",
      "sha256": "8bc703682fdb861a14a0a17b6bcf763cec758043c7d844c9e64517b841f12e06",
      "start": 76.1479365079365,
      "duration": 1.3216780045351475,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_16",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "Don't use the front, the back door sticks but the front's got that loose...",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_16.wav",
      "sha256": "16f75089c6cfd629a6e9599f56d570fbfe609fa610e01eaecb730af7bae59cfc",
      "start": 77.86961451247166,
      "duration": 2.915079365079365,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_18",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "Is what I've heard. Legally.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_18.wav",
      "sha256": "775f51e52d01653396ba68acfcc9ed558f1b6dce0dd7f436b2ea23140c9750ca",
      "start": 82.43469387755103,
      "duration": 1.420204081632653,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03_19",
      "who": "rocco",
      "text": "Busy guy. Lots of legal hearing.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s03_19.wav",
      "sha256": "7eaa2d6529b41e5af50f2e6441e1d68184d14854648cefaad78af79aa8c9ca66",
      "start": 84.25489795918368,
      "duration": 2.024875283446712,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s04_00",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "Friends. If I don't come back, tell my family I won. At anything. Doesn't matter what.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s04_00.wav",
      "sha256": "22d260d50d9d3981fdf01aab11c94145a59b65d0bdfd86b4ae072d96b6727fa5",
      "start": 89.25,
      "duration": 4.545419501133787,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s04_01",
      "who": "rocco",
      "text": "This is the longest three metres of my life.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s04_01.wav",
      "sha256": "fb0d0d81dc9969c8eef16aa92b327affd1330f0a41739d2071c5d809d229aace",
      "start": 94.1954195011338,
      "duration": 2.278140589569161,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s04_02",
      "who": "pip",
      "text": "Should someone go with him?",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s04_02.wav",
      "sha256": "046677dfd01a0ddb9903e91156a16b40d975e8cfa8ffe9f334c839052e2ed610",
      "start": 96.87356009070297,
      "duration": 0.9,
      "quiet": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s04_03",
      "who": "rocco",
      "text": "He's got a good pace. Very respectful.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s04_03.wav",
      "sha256": "6423e190819f99782419619982c4f90e30e1b819fea8022962996503aad12e49",
      "start": 98.17356009070298,
      "duration": 2.114421768707483,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s04b_00",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "Touching it. I'm touching it. It's touched.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s04b_00.wav",
      "sha256": "9cb2544d3f1b3952780b29bfd2656b436ac45632d89f327ef4544ab2cb511c18",
      "start": 102.25,
      "duration": 2.454875283446712,
      "quiet": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s04b_02",
      "who": "pip",
      "text": "It's not supposed to do that.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s04b_02.wav",
      "sha256": "5fa6f15e62fdf58503b4c29f70745ea543b39f2b97400c5eb17f69f26dc87dfe",
      "start": 108.9,
      "duration": 1.0428798185941044,
      "quiet": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s04b_03",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "It's not.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s04b_03.wav",
      "sha256": "719e5dc8ed7e77cf696ca633c0b9af8373ee4c683d7ff0a0a778499f0fbe907a",
      "start": 110.34287981859411,
      "duration": 0.8026757369614512,
      "quiet": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s05_00",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "Whoa! Aah!",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s05_00.wav",
      "sha256": "fa1669a1ee502d3d53f956f63edfdda3ce11895dbbe1e5b83a2aabfb70413596",
      "start": 114.31666666666668,
      "duration": 1.138140589569161,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s05_01",
      "who": "pip",
      "text": "Eek! Aah!",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s05_01.wav",
      "sha256": "50d9dc9d1bf8326ed00b6a6f1497fef8113c21a2ffe1b88290e719539bac3f54",
      "start": 115.85480725623584,
      "duration": 0.8597052154195012,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s05_02",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "Whoa! Aah!",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s05_02.wav",
      "sha256": "599f0fb3ac91ec10dbf944de13c6ed5d58846cded0fb332311aa2300004a6f4a",
      "start": 116.00480725623585,
      "duration": 1.0840816326530611,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s05_03",
      "who": "rocco",
      "text": "Ah.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s05b_00.wav",
      "sha256": "c39ee951fa89fd88cef5f7a7ece99947d4532d01eeefecf43eb859e115653d7f",
      "start": 118.43888888888891,
      "duration": 0.4245578231292517,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s06_00",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "I wasn't scared. I was warming up.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s06_00.wav",
      "sha256": "0c4bc0395bb1f389697707370e787ab8b37efe3982ad720445bf051d04d5f118",
      "start": 122.13333333333333,
      "duration": 2.143015873015873,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s06_01",
      "who": "riot",
      "text": "Warming up for what?",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s06_01.wav",
      "sha256": "22bdf758d894e8857ed3944186135ca2e12c3272a1c6f60236758076173d7800",
      "start": 124.6763492063492,
      "duration": 0.9570521541950113,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s06_02",
      "who": "bash",
      "text": "The screaming. You have to warm up or you pull something.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s06_02.wav",
      "sha256": "0012815f009c53d3cc2fb289c11a090cbcda64c4cc18f279384bf92a07f274d2",
      "start": 126.03340136054422,
      "duration": 2.9813832199546484,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s06_03",
      "who": "rocco",
      "text": "You warmed up for a very long time.",
      "source": "/Users/lazaretchaava/Desktop/Blender/videos/ep02/vo/s06_03.wav",
      "sha256": "d993380b0c137a7c2d8a81f02311353a7597d6866f6dcc82ea84e26aaef9dba1",
      "start": 129.41478458049886,
      "duration": 1.7930385487528344,
      "quiet": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s06_04",
